# DEV ONLY (bring-up). Dropbear's options, read by dropbear.service.
# -s: no password logins. The A7S bring-up's root has no password (the base's console policy is
# root login off), so without -s a password login would need a blank password; with -s the bench
# key is the only way in over SSH. (The B13 open point, closed in B19.)
DROPBEAR_ARGS="-s"
